  "instructions": [
    "Heat the vegetable oil in a large skillet or wok over medium high heat.",
    "Add the sliced onions and cook until they are caramelized and golden brown.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the ground annatto and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the cooked rice noodles and stir to combine with the onion and garlic mixture.",
    "Add the soy sauce and oyster sauce if using and stir to combine.",
    "Cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Stir in the chopped scallions.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy."
